          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports increased worry over the last 3–4 weeks, difficulty keeping worry under control, feeling on edge most days, and muscle tension in shoulders and jaw. Worry is mainly about health, especially dementia and cancer, with frequent reassurance-seeking."
      }
    },
    {
